mages/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/30px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 3 Spell Slot</a> \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Superior_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation\"> Condition: Superior Elixir of Arcane Cultivation </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Superior_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_(Condition)\" title=\"Superior Elixir of Arcane Cultivation (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/12/ELX_Greater_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-ELX_Greater_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/12/ELX_Greater_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-ELX_Greater_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/12/ELX_Greater_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-ELX_Greater_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Superior Elixir of Arcane Cultivation\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/12/ELX_Greater_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-ELX_Greater_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/12/ELX_Greater_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Superior_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_(Condition)\" title=\"Superior Elixir of Arcane Cultivation (Condition)\">Superior Elixir of Arcane Cultivation</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: Until <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a></p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Has an additional <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/30px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 3 Spell Slot</a>. Replaces effects from other elixirs when drunk.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Can be crafted via <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy\" title=\"Alchemy\">Alchemy</a> by combining <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Solution_of_Night_Orchid\" title=\"Solution of Night Orchid\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Suspension_of_Bullywug_Trumpet_Item_Icon.png/20px-Suspension_of_Bullywug_Trumpet_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Suspension_of_Bullywug_Trumpet_Item_Icon.png/30px-Suspension_of_Bullywug_Trumpet_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Suspension_of_Bullywug_Trumpet_Item_Icon.png/40px-Suspension_of_Bullywug_Trumpet_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Suspension_of_Bullywug_Trumpet_Item_Icon.png/20px-Suspension_of_Bullywug_Trumpet_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6d/Suspension_of_Bullywug_Trumpet_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Solution_of_Night_Orchid\" title=\"Solution of Night Orchid\">Solution of Night Orchid</a> (procured from <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Night_Orchid\" title=\"Night Orchid\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Night_Orchid_Item_Icon.png/20px-Night_Orchid_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Night_Orchid_Item_Icon.png/30px-Night_Orchid_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Night_Orchid_Item_Icon.png/40px-Night_Orchid_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Night_Orchid_Item_Icon.png/20px-Night_Orchid_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Night_Orchid_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Night_Orchid\" title=\"Night Orchid\">Night Orchid</a>) and any <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy#Extractions\" title=\"Alchemy\">Vitriol</a></li>\n<li>Can be sold by any merchant that has the <a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_Table\" title=\"Elixir Table\">Elixir Table</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Potion_Table\" title=\"Potion Table\">Potion Table</a> <em>starting at level 6</em>. As stock is semi-random, merchants may have anywhere from 0 to 2.</li></ul>\n</div>      \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 150.66666666667px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 148.66666666667px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Superior_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Model.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"In-game model\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/Superior_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Model.png/223px-Superior_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Model.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/79/Superior_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Model.png/335px-Superior_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Model.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/79/Superior_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Model.png/447px-Superior_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Model.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"In-game model\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/Superior_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Model.png/223px-Superior_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Model.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"149\" height=\"250\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/79/Superior_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Model.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">In-game model</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202616\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.078 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.083 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2700/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 44394/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 11138/41943